flowchart LR
    Dev[Developer] --> Git[Git Push]
    Git --> GitHub[GitHub Repo]
    
    GitHub --> Trigger[Cloud Build Trigger]
    
    Trigger --> Build[Build Docker Images]
    Build --> Test[Run Tests]
    
    Test --> Pass{Tests Pass?}
    Pass -->|No| Fail([Build Failed])
    Pass -->|Yes| Push[Push to Artifact Registry]
    
    Push --> Deploy1[Deploy Backend<br/>Cloud Run]
    Push --> Deploy2[Deploy Frontend<br/>Cloud Run]
    
    Deploy1 --> HealthCheck[Health Check]
    Deploy2 --> HealthCheck
    
    HealthCheck --> Success{Healthy?}
    Success -->|No| Rollback([Rollback])
    Success -->|Yes| Live([Live in Production])
    
    Live --> Monitor[Cloud Monitoring]
    Monitor --> Alerts{Issues?}
    Alerts -->|Yes| PagerDuty[Alert Team]
    Alerts -->|No| Continue([Continue Running])
    
    style Pass fill:#4CAF50,stroke:#2E7D32,stroke-width:2px
    style Success fill:#4CAF50,stroke:#2E7D32,stroke-width:2px
    style Fail fill:#F44336,stroke:#C62828,stroke-width:2px
    style Rollback fill:#F44336,stroke:#C62828,stroke-width:2px

